=== VERBATIM WEB LOGIC PORTED + UNIT-PINNED ===
  fmtNumber(display, decimals): NumberFormatter(.decimal, grouping, min=max=decimals,
    .halfUp) with safeNumber(non-finite⇒0). render = prefix + fmtNumber + suffix.
  tick(): progress = min((now-start)/durationMs, 1); eased = 1-(1-progress)²;
    display = from + (to-from)*eased; from = 0 each (re)start (value/duration dep).
  Native enhancement (Apple HIG, like the shared TSAnimatedNumber atom): honour
    Reduce Motion by settling to the final value immediately (web always animates).

